        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables and values\n    principal = 20000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.055\n    years = 5\n\n    # Calculate the monthly payment and first month's interest\n    monthly_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_payments = years * 12\n    monthly_payment = (principal * monthly_rate) / (\n        1 - (1 + monthly_rate) ** -number_of_payments\n    )\n    first_month_interest = principal * monthly_rate\n\n    # The remainder of the first payment reduces the principal\n    principal_paid = round(monthly_payment - first_month_interest, 2)\n\n    return principal_paid\n```",
